buzzwords like bitcoin cryptocurrency  nft and the metaverse are becoming part  of everyday vocabulary and everyone from  major corporations to entrepreneurs to  the general public is starting to take  notice non-fungible tokens which are a  one-of-a-kind blockchain asset often  connected to a form of digital art have  particularly exploded over the past year  nft sales reached 24.9 billion dollars  in 2021 up from 94.9 million in 2020  according to dap radar nfts are  infiltrating every industry from art to  music to real estate it was only a  matter of time before they broke into  the food and hospitality sector in  december 2021 celebrity chef tom  colecchio announced on twitter that he  was entering the nft space with top chef  spike mendelson they released 8 888  pizza themed nfts called chefty pizzas  valued at around 200 each  some restaurants are taking the concept  one step further offering token holders  exclusive memberships and perks as part  of their nft ownership in 2021  entrepreneurs david rodelitz gary  vaynerchuk and chef josh capen announced  their venture fly fish club dubbed the  world's first ever nft restaurant a fly  fish club nft grants the owner unlimited  access to a members only private dining  venue in new york city along with a  series of exclusive digital and  in-person special events  even though the exact location of the  club which is slated to open sometime in  2023 is still to be determined all 1500  nfts released to the public sold out in  minutes  initial prices for the nfts range from  around eight thousand dollars in the  basic tier to fourteen thousand dollars  for the premier tier though their recent  resale values are going for nearly  double those amounts  there's also an nft with perks at a  restaurant that is already open for  business chotomate the pioneering global  nikkei dining destination with locations  in london toronto and miami beach  recently announced it would release its  first nft in april dubbed the founder  the nft will be a one-time release  collectible chip card that grants its  owner exclusive membership access with  an array of benefits redeemable all over  the world  perks include invitations to every  chotomate restaurant opening around the  world plus first class flights and  five-star accommodations an annual  distillery vineyard and premium farm  visit new year's eve dinner invitation  for six at any chotamate location an  exclusive at-home experience with the  restaurant's executive chef two tickets  to one major sports event a year and  more  there will only be one founder nft  produced and it is currently the only  chotamate membership available adding to  its exclusivity the founder nft will be  available for purchase on openc for 1  million  there will be a launch event at its  miami beach location on april 5th during  miami nft week and the bitcoin 2020  miami beach conference which are  expected to welcome thousands of crypto  enthusiasts from all over the world  back in new york city the popular  brooklyn chop house from restauranteurs  robert dompu cummins and stratus  morphigan is also getting into the  crypto game this month the steakhouse  opened its highly anticipated five-story  25 000 square foot times square location  the space includes an intimate seller  area that starting in early fall will be  only accessible to guests who have  purchased the special nft membership  according to the new york post the  starting price for the basic membership  is around eight thousand dollars though  more expensive tiers which range from  twenty thousand to one million will open  up even more exclusive perks as the  popularity of cryptocurrency in the  metaverse continues to grow we're bound  to see more chefs and restaurants get a  taste for the nft space the only  question remains are the rest of us  willing to take a bite  [Music]
 

